{{h1}}Mako

{{h2}}Authoring
- Follow the configured expression, control-flow, inheritance, and include conventions.
- Keep complex application behaviour in Python rather than inline template code.
- Confirm the configured escaping approach before emitting HTML or other sensitive output.
- Preserve whitespace conventions and validate rendered behaviour.

